%% State 08b — ProjectSprint review lifecycle
%% Evidence status: Implemented.
%% Updated 2026-07-27 (code-verified).
%% Ref: CloseProjectSprintReviewCommand and sprint_review_rules.ts.

stateDiagram-v2
direction LR
    [*] --> draft : createSprint<br/>[status omitted or draft]
    [*] --> active : createSprint [status = active]<br/>or review-close rollover
    draft --> active : startSprint
    active --> review_open : closeSprintReview [task reviews done and previous reverse reviews done] / create packages, reverse workflows and next sprint
    review_open --> review_closed : closeReviewPeriod
    review_closed --> archived : archiveSprint
    archived --> [*]

    note right of active
        Guard reads task_review_workflows and prior
        sprint reverse-review debt.
        Review debt rejects closeSprintReview and leaves
        the sprint active; rejection is not a transition.
    end note

    note right of review_open
        sprint_review_packages are submitted records.
        sprint_reverse_review_workflows are board state.
        CloseProjectSprintReviewCommand creates the next
        sprint directly in active status.
    end note
